Legal texts

The texts are official acts of the Democratic Republic of Timor-Leste, taken from the Jornal da Republica published
by the Ministry of Justice (https://www.mj.gov.tl/jornal/). No terms of use or licence were found on that site
(checked 2026-10-28), and none is granted here. Reuse terms are unclear, so this repository is private. When quoting,
cite: "Jornal da Republica, Republica Democratica de Timor-Leste, Ministerio da Justica" with the series, number and
date of the issue (see the Published: and Source: trailers of each commit).

